WEBVTT

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.220
Dad wants us to pick
up where he left off --

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:20.430
Saving people, hunting things.

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:21.800
The family business.

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:27.750
I have these nightmares,
and sometimes they come true.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:29.380
Come again?

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:31.890
I dreamt about jessica's
death before it happened.

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:34.540
A vision. Started out as nightmares.

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:36.350
Then he started having
them while he was awake.

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:39.670
The closer I get to anything involving
the demon, the stronger the visions get.

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:43.320
The demon said he had plans
for me and the children like me.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:45.060
Do you have any idea
what he meant by that?

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:46.370
No,I don'T.

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:49.400
Max,your abilities -They started
six,seven months ago,right?

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.200
How'd you know that?

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:52.200
'Cause that's when my abilities started.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:53.540
The same thing killed our mothers.

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:55.480
You and I are chosen.

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:57.510
For what? I don't know.

00:00:57.510 --> 00:01:01.110
The thing I don't get is why.
I guess because we're so alike?

00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:03.470
Max is nothing like you.
Sam,max is a monster.

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:05.420
He's already killed two people.
Now he's gunning for a third.

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:11.440
Did he say anything to you?

00:01:11.710 --> 00:01:13.190
No.

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:15.890
Nothing.

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:40.570
Hello? Yeah.

00:01:42.710 --> 00:01:44.380
All right.

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:13.010
Afternoon,dennis. Hey,doc.

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:15.240
I'd like to look at a gun.

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:18.200
Yeah,right,doc.

00:02:19.540 --> 00:02:21.670
Seriously?

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:32.520
That one.

00:02:34.790 --> 00:02:36.790
Okay.

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:42.670
That's a turkey hunter.
12-Gauge. Pump-Action.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.610
Don't leave enough turkey
behind,if you ask me.

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:50.690
What,uh,what sort of shells does it use?

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:53.740
Right here.

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:57.260
I'm taking the boys up to the
cabin this weekend,if you're,uh...

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:01.300
I mean,if you think you might
like to take up the sport.

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:03.390
Thanks,but no.

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:05.930
You know guns make me
nervous. Always have.

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:07.820
This one goes in here, right?

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:12.050
Whoa. Doc! No,no,you can't load a
weapon on the premises. It's illegal!

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:13.640
It's okay,dennis. No,no.

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:18.280
It's okay,dennis. It's all gonna be

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:20.040
Okay.

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:21.440
Doc!

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:24.070
What's going on?

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:27.540
No,no,it's okay. It's okay.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:31.930
It's all gonna be... okay.

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:51.730
Sam,come on,zip it up. Let's hit the...

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.010
Road.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:55.470
What?

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:14.760
I don't know,man. Why don't we
just chill out,think about this?

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:18.550
What's there to think about?

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:20.900
Just don't know if going to the
roadhouse is the smartest idea.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.010
Dean,it's another
premonition. I know it.

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:27.250
This is gonna happen,and ash can tell us where.
Plus it could have some connection with the demon.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:29.570
My visions always do. That's my point.

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:31.480
There's gonna be hunters
there. I don't know if --

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:34.390
If going in and announcing that
you're some supernatural freak

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:37.590
With a demonic connection
is the best thing,okay?

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:40.450
So I'm a freak now?

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:43.920
You've always been a freak.

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:59.040
Damn, little lady,
that was my room money.

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:01.560
Then I guess you're
taking a truck nap tonight.

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:05.080
I'd have checked the high scores
before you put your money down.

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:08.820
Went and got yourself hustled,ed.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:20.990
Just can't stay away,huh?

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:23.580
Yeah,looks like. How you doing,jo?

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:25.680
Where's ash? In his back room.

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:27.700
Great. And I'm fine.

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:31.820
Sorry. He's -We're kind
of on a bit of a timetable.

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:41.810
Ash?

00:05:41.810 --> 00:05:45.220
The conditions that led to
the sharpsville tragedy...

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:47.390
Hey,ash?

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:52.120
Hey,dr. Badass?

00:05:55.780 --> 00:05:58.450
Sam. Dean.

00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:01.110
Sam and dean.

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:06.340
Hey,ash, um,we need your help.

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:09.660
Hell,then, guess I need my pants.

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:17.980
So,I got a match. It's the logo
for the blue ridge bus lines.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:19.930
Guthrie,oklahoma.

00:06:19.930 --> 00:06:24.440
Okay. Do me a favor. Check guthrie for any
demonic signs or omens or anything like that.

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:27.170
You think the demon is there?

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:29.250
Yeah. Maybe.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:32.740
Why would you think that?
Just check it,all right?

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:39.280
No,sir,nothing. No demon.

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:43.110
All right. Try something else for me.

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:46.440
Search guthrie for a house
fire. It would be 1983.

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:50.580
Fire's origin would be a baby's nursery,
night of the kid's 6-Month birthday.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:58.650
Okay,now, that is just weird,man.

00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:01.560
Why the hell would i
be looking for that?

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:06.070
'Cause there's a pbr in it for you.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:08.720
Give me 15 minutes.

00:07:34.310 --> 00:07:35.590
What?

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:38.130
R.E.O. Speedwagon? Damn right,R.E.O.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.360
Kevin cronin sings it from the heart.

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:43.010
He sings it from the
hair. There's a difference.

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:49.600
That profile you've got ash looking for?

00:07:50.690 --> 00:07:52.940
Your mom died the
same way, didn't she --

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:55.400
The fire in sam's nursery?

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:58.940
Look,jo,it's kind of a
family thing. I could help.

00:07:58.940 --> 00:08:02.500
I'm sure you could,but we got
to handle this one ourselves.

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:06.590
Besides,if I ran off with you,
think your mother might kill me.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:11.440
You're afraid of my mother?

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:13.270
I think so.

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:15.220
We have a match. We got to go.

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:17.830
All right,jo, see you later.

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:27.670
And even as I wander
I'm keeping you in sight

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:34.420
You're a candle in the window
on a cold,dark winter's night

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:39.550
And I'm getting closer
than I ever thought

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:41.580
I mi-Ight

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:44.440
You're kidding,right?

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:48.770
I heard the song somewhere. I can't get it out
of my head. I don't know,man. What do you got?

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:53.480
Andrew gallagher.

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:56.930
Born in '83,like me.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:59.890
Lost his mother in a nursery
fire exactly six months later,

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:01.060
Also like me.

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:02.750
You think the demon killed his mom?

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:03.650
Sure looks like it.

00:09:03.650 --> 00:09:04.940
How did you know to look for this guy?

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:07.110
Every premonition I've had,
if they're not about the demon,

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:09.480
They're about the other
kids the demon visited.

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:10.840
Like max miller. Remember him?

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:13.450
Yeah,but max miller was
a basic little psycho.

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:16.790
Point is he was killing people,and I was
having the same type of visions about him.

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:19.450
And now it could be happening all
over again with this gallagher guy.

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:20.980
How do we find him? I don't know.

00:09:20.980 --> 00:09:23.520
No current address,
no current employment.

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:26.750
Still owes money on all his
bills -Phone,credit,utilities.

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:28.730
Collection agency flags?

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:30.210
Not in the system.

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:31.910
They just let him take a walk?

00:09:31.910 --> 00:09:33.660
Seems like it.

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:37.400
There's a work address from
his last w-2 about a year ago.

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:39.450
Let's start there.

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:49.840
You won't get anything out of
andy,guys. I'm sorry,but they never do.

00:09:50.530 --> 00:09:51.500
"They"?

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:53.760
You're debt collectors, right?

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:55.760
Once in a while, they come by.

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:59.260
I don't know what andy says to
them, but they never come back.

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:03.750
Actually,we're lawyers
representing his great-Aunt lita.

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:07.660
She passed -God rest her soul
-But left andy a sizable estate.

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:10.680
Yeah. So,are you a friend of his?

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:14.150
I used to be,yeah. I don't
see much of andy anymore.

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:17.690
Andy? Andy kicks ass,man. Is that right?

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:19.600
Yeah. Andy can get you into anything.

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:22.530
He even got me backstage at
aerosmith once. It was beautiful,bro.

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:25.940
How about busing a table or two,webber?

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:29.270
Yeah,you bet,boss.

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:32.880
Look,if you want to find
him, try orchard street.

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:36.210
Just look for a van with the
barbarian queen painted on the side.

00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:37.730
Barbarian queen.

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:40.880
She's riding a polar bear.
It's kind of hard to miss.

00:10:45.610 --> 00:10:48.870
I'm sorry. I'm starting to like
this dude. That van is sweet.

00:10:53.070 --> 00:10:55.860
What's wrong? Nothing.

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:58.310
Sam,you look like you're
sucking on a lemon.

00:10:58.310 --> 00:11:02.190
This andrew gallagher -He's the
second guy like this we've found,dean.

00:11:02.530 --> 00:11:05.170
Demon came to them when they were
kids. Now they're killing people.

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:07.630
We don't know what andrew
gallagher is. Could be innocent.

00:11:07.630 --> 00:11:09.160
My visions haven't been wrong yet.

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:10.760
What's your point?

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:13.850
My point is I'm one
of them. No,you're not.

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:16.760
Dean,the demon said he had plans
for me and children like me.

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:17.690
Yeah?

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:21.660
Maybe this is his plan. Maybe
we're all a bunch of psychic freaks.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:23.430
Maybe we're all
supposed to be --

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:24.390
Killers? Yeah.

00:11:24.390 --> 00:11:27.340
So the demon wants you out
there,killing with your minds?

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:30.310
Give me a break. You're
not a murderer,sam!

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:32.850
You don't have it in your bones.

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:35.270
No?

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:38.760
Last I checked, I kill
all kinds of things.

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:41.090
Those things were asking for it.

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:43.330
There's a difference.

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:58.080
Got him.

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:28.190
That's him,that older
guy. He's the shooter.

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:32.640
Well,you keep on him.
I'll stick with andy.

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:22.520
Hey! Hey.

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:25.590
This is a cherry ride. Yeah. Thanks.

00:13:25.590 --> 00:13:29.840
Man,you know,'67 -Impala's
best year,if you ask me.

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:31.630
This is a serious classic.

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:35.480
You know,I just rebuilt her,too.
Can't let a car like this one go.

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:37.160
Damn straight.

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:40.050
Hey. Could I have it? Sure,man.

00:13:41.390 --> 00:13:43.350
Sweet.

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:47.980
Hop right in there.
There you go. Very nice.

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:50.670
Take it easy. All right.

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:06.230
Hello? Yeah.

00:14:55.190 --> 00:14:58.250
Hello? Yeah.

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:02.310
Dean, andy's got the impala!

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:05.970
I know! He just sort of asked
me for it, and I let him take it.

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:06.760
You what?

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:10.400
He full-On obi-Wan'd me.
It's mind control,man.

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:31.620
I kept him out of the gun store.

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:36.060
I thought he was okay.

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:39.750
I thought he was past it. At least...

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:43.510
I should've stayed with him.

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:49.050
Andy! What's up,dog?

00:15:50.650 --> 00:15:52.420
Andy.

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:55.390
What are you doing here?

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:59.040
D-Dr. Jennings.

00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:01.610
He's dead.

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:04.910
Oh,no,I-I'm sorry.

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:07.280
I don't know. I-I...

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:13.140
I just -I was upset,
and I wanted to see you.

00:16:13.960 --> 00:16:17.670
Well,I'm glad you did. I,um...

00:16:20.190 --> 00:16:22.700
I missed you.

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:30.500
Oh,you know what? Some guys were
here this morning,looking for you.

00:16:31.810 --> 00:16:33.890
What guys?

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:40.110
Thank god!

00:16:42.720 --> 00:16:45.930
I'm sorry,baby. I'll
never leave you again.

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:50.810
At least he left the keys in it.

00:16:50.810 --> 00:16:53.580
Yeah. Real samaritan,this guy.

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:57.570
It looks like he can't work his mojo just by
twitching his nose. He's got to use verbal commands.

00:16:57.570 --> 00:17:01.330
The doctor had just gotten off his cellphone
when he stepped in front of that bus.

00:17:03.260 --> 00:17:05.280
Andy must've called him or something.

00:17:06.050 --> 00:17:08.640
I don't know. Maybe. Beg your pardon?

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:10.070
I just don't know if he's our guy,sam.

00:17:10.070 --> 00:17:13.670
You had O.J. Convicted before he got out of
his bronco,and you have doubts about this?

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:16.530
He doesn't seem like the
stone-Cold killer type. That's all.

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:18.040
And O.J. Was guilty.

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:20.460
Either way,how are we
gonna track this guy down?

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:24.200
Not a problem.

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:28.330
Not exactly an inconspicuous ride.

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:30.780
Let's have a look.

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:39.140
Oh,come on.

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:43.700
This is -This is magnificent.
That's what this is.

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:47.620
Not exactly a serial
killer's lair,though.

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:51.190
There's no clown paintings on the walls

00:17:51.190 --> 00:17:53.770
Or scissors stuck in victims' photos.

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:55.840
I like the tiger.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:58.690
Hegel? Kant?

00:17:58.690 --> 00:18:01.650
Wittgenstein? That's some
pretty heavy reading,dean.

00:18:01.650 --> 00:18:04.090
Yeah,and,uh...

00:18:04.090 --> 00:18:06.940
Moby dick's bong.

00:18:16.850 --> 00:18:19.580
You know,one day I'd
love to just sit down

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:22.370
And eat something that I didn't
have to microwave at a minimart.

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:26.230
What I don't get is the motive.
The doctor was squeaky clean.

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:27.790
Why would andy waste him?

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:29.430
If it is andy.

00:18:29.430 --> 00:18:31.480
Dude,enough. Why?

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:33.920
The doctor was mind-Controlled
in front of a bus.

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:37.300
Andy just happens to have the power
of mind control. You do the math.

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:38.990
I don't think the guy has it in him.

00:18:38.990 --> 00:18:40.260
How the hell would you know?

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:41.850
Why are you bending over
backwards defending him?

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:42.930
'Cause you're not right about this.

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:44.540
About andy?

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:47.030
Hey! You think I haven't seen you two?

00:18:47.030 --> 00:18:49.550
Why are you following me?

00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:51.850
Well,we're lawyers. A
relative of yours has --

00:18:51.850 --> 00:18:54.880
Tell the truth!
That's what --

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:57.670
We hunt demons. What?

00:18:57.670 --> 00:19:01.350
Demons and spirits. Things your
worst nightmares wouldn't even touch.

00:19:01.350 --> 00:19:03.120
Sam's my brother. Dean,shut up.

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:06.160
I'm trying. He's psychic,like
you. Well,not really like you.

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:07.620
He thinks you're a murderer,

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:11.160
And he's afraid he's gonna become one himself
cause you're all part of something that's terrible.

00:19:11.160 --> 00:19:14.790
I hope to hell that he's wrong, but I'm
starting to get scared he might be right.

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:18.070
Okay,you know what? Just leave me alone.

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:20.260
All right?

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:26.100
What are you doing?
Look,I-I said,leave me alone.

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:29.110
Get out of here! Just start
driving and never stop!

00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:31.120
Doesn't seem to work on me,andy.

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:32.480
What?

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:35.080
You can make people
do things, can't you?

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:36.940
You can tell them what to think.

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:38.950
That's crazy.

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:41.170
All started a year ago, didn't it?

00:19:41.170 --> 00:19:45.000
After you turned 22. Little stuff at first,
then you got better at controlling it.

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:46.170
How do you know all this?

00:19:46.170 --> 00:19:49.720
'Cause the same thing happened to
me,andy. My mom died in a fire,too.

00:19:49.720 --> 00:19:52.300
I have abilities,too.

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:53.760
You see,we're connected, you and me.

00:19:53.760 --> 00:19:55.840
Just -Just get out of here!

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:58.520
Why did you tell the doctor
to walk in front of a bus?

00:19:58.520 --> 00:20:00.320
What?

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:10.040
Why did you kill him? I didn'T.

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:19.990
Hello?

00:20:22.010 --> 00:20:23.580
Sure.

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:26.200
I can do that.

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:56.650
Hey!

00:20:57.070 --> 00:20:59.370
Lady,what are you doing?!
It's gonna be okay.

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:02.260
Lady,no. No!

00:21:14.470 --> 00:21:16.570
Sam? What is it?

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:18.530
I didn't do anything to him.

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:23.980
A woman. A woman burning alive.

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:24.710
What else you get?

00:21:24.710 --> 00:21:27.070
A gas station. A woman
is gonna kill herself.

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:28.500
What does he mean, "going to"?

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:30.230
Shut up.

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:32.480
She gets triggered
by a call on her cell.

00:21:32.480 --> 00:21:34.320
When? I don't know.

00:21:34.320 --> 00:21:36.990
As long as we keep our eyes on this
son of a bitch,he can't hurt her.

00:21:36.990 --> 00:21:39.160
I didn't hurt anybody! Yeah,not yet.

00:21:45.670 --> 00:21:47.170
Go.

00:21:47.620 --> 00:21:49.290
No. Not you.

00:21:49.470 --> 00:21:51.720
You're staying here with me.

00:21:54.290 --> 00:21:57.290
Hey,it's me. She's dead.
Burned up,just like you said.

00:21:58.350 --> 00:21:59.180
When?

00:21:59.180 --> 00:22:01.780
Minutes before I got here.
The smell hasn't even cleared.

00:22:01.780 --> 00:22:04.090
What's up with your visions?
This wasn't even a head start.

00:22:04.090 --> 00:22:06.920
I can't control them. I don't
know what the hell is going on.

00:22:06.920 --> 00:22:10.120
You were with andy when this whole
thing went down,so it can't be him.

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:11.710
It's got to be somebody else.

00:22:11.710 --> 00:22:12.750
That doesn't make any sense.

00:22:12.750 --> 00:22:15.810
What else is new? I'll dig around
here, see what else I can find.

00:22:21.110 --> 00:22:25.600
You get these premonitions
of people about to die?

00:22:26.930 --> 00:22:28.870
That's impossible.

00:22:30.810 --> 00:22:33.280
A lot of people would say the
same thing about what you do.

00:22:35.240 --> 00:22:36.890
Death visions? Yeah.

00:22:37.300 --> 00:22:38.950
Dude,that sucks.

00:22:38.950 --> 00:22:42.590
When I got my mind
thing, it was like a gift.

00:22:42.590 --> 00:22:44.030
It was like I won the lotto.

00:22:44.030 --> 00:22:46.730
But you still live in a van.

00:22:47.310 --> 00:22:50.500
I don't get it. You could
have anything you ever wanted.

00:22:51.810 --> 00:22:55.400
Yeah,but I-I got everything I need.

00:22:58.700 --> 00:23:00.470
So you're really not a killer,huh?

00:23:00.470 --> 00:23:03.420
That's what I've been
trying to tell you.

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:06.520
That's good.

00:23:06.520 --> 00:23:08.810
That means there's hope for both of us.

00:23:16.060 --> 00:23:18.950
Victim's name was holly
beckett. 41. Single.

00:23:18.950 --> 00:23:21.360
Who is she? Never heard of her.

00:23:21.360 --> 00:23:24.050
I called ash on the way over. He
came up with a little something.

00:23:24.410 --> 00:23:28.610
Apparently holly beckett gave birth
when she was 18 years old,back in 1983 --

00:23:28.610 --> 00:23:30.980
Same day you were born,andy.

00:23:32.130 --> 00:23:34.520
Andy, were you adopted?

00:23:34.750 --> 00:23:35.720
Well,yeah.

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:38.930
You were? And you
neglected to mention that?

00:23:39.280 --> 00:23:43.370
It never really came up. I mean,I
never knew my birth parents,

00:23:43.370 --> 00:23:47.310
And,like you said, my adopted
mom died when I was a baby.

00:23:47.310 --> 00:23:49.590
Do you think this holly
woman could actually be --

00:23:49.590 --> 00:23:53.750
I don't know. Tried to get a copy of the birth
records,but they're sealed in the county office.

00:23:55.100 --> 00:23:57.040
Well,screw that.

00:23:58.760 --> 00:24:00.990
Probably shouldn't have
let you kids in here.

00:24:00.990 --> 00:24:03.230
No. It'll all be fine, all right?

00:24:03.230 --> 00:24:05.920
Just go get a cup of coffee, all right?

00:24:06.310 --> 00:24:08.810
These aren't the droids
you're looking for.

00:24:09.440 --> 00:24:11.220
Awesome.

00:24:11.560 --> 00:24:12.880
I got it. Yeah?

00:24:12.880 --> 00:24:16.150
Yeah.

00:24:16.150 --> 00:24:18.220
Andy,it's true.

00:24:18.600 --> 00:24:21.900
Holly beckett was your birth mother.

00:24:23.580 --> 00:24:24.850
Does anyone have a vicodin?

00:24:24.850 --> 00:24:26.890
Dr. Jennings was her doctor,too.

00:24:26.890 --> 00:24:30.020
I mean, he oversaw the adoption.

00:24:30.370 --> 00:24:32.090
You have a solid
connection to both of them.

00:24:32.090 --> 00:24:34.720
Yeah,but I didn't kill
them. We believe you.

00:24:36.200 --> 00:24:38.800
Yeah. But,uh,who did?

00:24:38.800 --> 00:24:41.250
I think I got a pretty good guess.

00:24:42.230 --> 00:24:45.020
Holly beckett gave birth to twins.

00:24:46.260 --> 00:24:49.180
I have an evil twin.

00:24:49.890 --> 00:24:52.770
Holly put you and your
brother up for adoption.

00:24:52.770 --> 00:24:56.410
And you went to the
gallagher family,obviously,

00:24:56.410 --> 00:25:00.410
And your brother went to the
weems family from upstate.

00:25:01.840 --> 00:25:03.910
Andy,how you doing? Still with us?

00:25:05.820 --> 00:25:07.110
Um...what was my brother's name?

00:25:07.110 --> 00:25:10.780
Here. Um,ansem weems?

00:25:11.950 --> 00:25:14.500
He's got a local address. He lives here?

00:25:14.500 --> 00:25:16.170
Let's get a look at him.

00:25:16.170 --> 00:25:18.930
Got his picture coming
over from the dmv right now.

00:25:28.640 --> 00:25:31.480
Hate to kick you while you're freaked.

00:25:32.920 --> 00:25:34.860
Take a look at that.

00:25:38.800 --> 00:25:40.950
Hey,trace? Yeah?

00:25:42.600 --> 00:25:46.060
You and andy,you guys went
together for a while,didn't you?

00:25:46.620 --> 00:25:48.250
Yeah,webber,why?

00:25:48.250 --> 00:25:52.610
I don't know. Just wondering. I was
wondering how you felt about him these days.

00:25:52.610 --> 00:25:56.170
I mean,I've seen you guys together. It
seems like there's still something there.

00:25:57.790 --> 00:26:00.740
Were you guys ever, like,serious?

00:26:01.130 --> 00:26:02.940
Um...no.

00:26:02.940 --> 00:26:05.670
Come on,trace. Tell the truth.

00:26:08.630 --> 00:26:11.550
All right,andy,tell us everything
you know about this guy.

00:26:13.120 --> 00:26:18.360
I don't know much. Webber shows
up one day like eight months ago,

00:26:18.360 --> 00:26:20.510
Acting like he's my
best friend in the world.

00:26:20.510 --> 00:26:23.070
He's kind of weird,like
trying too hard,you know?

00:26:23.070 --> 00:26:24.790
He must've known you guys are twins.

00:26:24.790 --> 00:26:27.290
Why did he change his name?
Why not tell you the truth?

00:26:29.740 --> 00:26:31.300
Sam?

00:27:20.860 --> 00:27:22.210
Sam? Oh,god!

00:27:22.210 --> 00:27:24.130
Sam?!

00:27:24.520 --> 00:27:25.730
Sam!

00:27:28.720 --> 00:27:30.630
Hey. Hey!

00:27:43.040 --> 00:27:44.940
I take my ladies here.

00:27:46.800 --> 00:27:48.840
They like it.

00:27:49.750 --> 00:27:53.590
Well,I mean,I like it,
so,of course,they do,too.

00:27:57.220 --> 00:28:00.600
Please. I just want to go home.

00:28:00.600 --> 00:28:03.260
Stop crying.

00:28:05.100 --> 00:28:07.120
Hey.

00:28:09.230 --> 00:28:12.110
I get it. I see what you see in andy.

00:28:12.110 --> 00:28:15.400
I mean,he's a genius.
The books he reads --

00:28:15.400 --> 00:28:18.280
He's gonna be a great man someday.

00:28:21.210 --> 00:28:24.940
But he is my family, not yours.

00:28:25.680 --> 00:28:28.230
You can't have him.

00:28:28.230 --> 00:28:31.460
You're not gonna have
anything after tonight.

00:28:47.260 --> 00:28:48.530
Dean, you should stay back.

00:28:48.530 --> 00:28:51.660
No argument here. I had my head
screwed with enough for one day.

00:28:56.620 --> 00:28:59.910
I'm coming with
you. Andy --

00:28:59.910 --> 00:29:03.630
That's tracy out there, and I'm coming.

00:29:07.040 --> 00:29:10.270
Okay. Ch-Ch--
Slower.

00:29:14.930 --> 00:29:16.940
Tracy...

00:29:17.960 --> 00:29:21.260
I want you to listen to
me very carefully,okay?

00:29:23.110 --> 00:29:25.740
When we're done here

00:29:27.150 --> 00:29:32.320
I want you to head over to
the edge of that dam,okay?

00:29:34.410 --> 00:29:36.060
Okay.

00:29:37.680 --> 00:29:39.920
And when you get there

00:29:41.090 --> 00:29:43.560
You're gonna think you can fly.

00:29:45.790 --> 00:29:48.880
And you're just gonna step right off.

00:29:51.540 --> 00:29:54.140
You -You can fly,can't you?

00:29:56.650 --> 00:29:59.760
Yeah. I think so.

00:29:59.760 --> 00:30:01.500
You might get scared,

00:30:01.500 --> 00:30:05.370
But I want you to say that it's okay.

00:30:07.490 --> 00:30:12.940
Just tell yourself,
"everything is okay."

00:30:14.510 --> 00:30:16.720
Get out of the car! Now!

00:30:16.720 --> 00:30:19.080
You really don't want to do this.

00:30:20.950 --> 00:30:22.750
Trace,give me your hand.
Come here,come here.

00:30:22.750 --> 00:30:26.870
I couldn't control myself.

00:30:26.870 --> 00:30:29.830
Hey! Don't move. Don't move!

00:30:31.770 --> 00:30:33.420
No! No! I will kill you!

00:30:33.420 --> 00:30:34.940
Andy! Hey,hey,hey! No!
No! I'll handle this!

00:30:35.010 --> 00:30:38.260
I will kill you!

00:30:38.260 --> 00:30:41.110
Andy,listen to me! Just listen to me!

00:30:43.100 --> 00:30:46.780
Tracy,stop! I said,stop it!

00:30:58.200 --> 00:31:00.840
How did you do that? Practice,bro.

00:31:01.610 --> 00:31:04.160
If you just practiced, you would know.

00:31:04.160 --> 00:31:07.320
Sometimes... you don't
need to use your words.

00:31:07.320 --> 00:31:10.970
If you have to, all you need is this.

00:31:11.450 --> 00:31:12.990
Sometimes the headache is worth it.

00:31:12.990 --> 00:31:14.470
You twisted son of a bitch!

00:31:14.470 --> 00:31:17.690
Back off,andy! Or tracy is
gonna do a little flying.

00:31:25.260 --> 00:31:27.570
Aren't you,trace?

00:31:29.260 --> 00:31:32.440
I'm stronger than you. I can do it.

00:31:35.480 --> 00:31:38.140
Okay,okay. Okay.

00:31:38.140 --> 00:31:41.340
All right,just... please don't hurt her.

00:31:41.340 --> 00:31:44.550
Don't be mad at me,okay?
I know. It's all wrong.

00:31:44.550 --> 00:31:47.110
I didn't mean for this
to happen. It's just...

00:31:48.030 --> 00:31:50.240
Tracy
--

00:31:50.670 --> 00:31:53.030
She's trying to come between us.

00:31:53.030 --> 00:31:54.880
You're insane. She's garbage!

00:31:54.880 --> 00:31:56.640
Man,they all are!

00:31:56.640 --> 00:31:59.380
We can push them. We can
make them do whatever we want!

00:32:01.160 --> 00:32:04.240
Are you really -Are you
really this stupid? Is it --

00:32:05.220 --> 00:32:08.020
You learn you got a twin,

00:32:08.020 --> 00:32:10.540
You call him up, you go out for a drink.

00:32:10.540 --> 00:32:12.700
You don't start killing people!

00:32:12.700 --> 00:32:16.610
I wanted to tell you
for so long,bro,but...

00:32:18.030 --> 00:32:20.770
He didn't let me. He said I
had to wait until the time --

00:32:20.770 --> 00:32:23.190
Who? The man with the yellow eyes.

00:32:26.550 --> 00:32:27.700
What are you talking about?

00:32:27.700 --> 00:32:31.300
He came to me... in my dream.

00:32:32.770 --> 00:32:35.200
He said I was special.

00:32:35.670 --> 00:32:38.950
He told me he's got big plans for me.

00:32:38.950 --> 00:32:41.830
Wait till you see what's in
store,andy,for both of us.

00:32:43.260 --> 00:32:48.870
See,he's the one who told me
that I had a brother,a twin.

00:32:55.640 --> 00:32:57.720
Why did you kill our mother?

00:32:57.720 --> 00:32:59.410
And why dr. Jennings?

00:32:59.410 --> 00:33:02.120
Because they split us up!

00:33:02.760 --> 00:33:05.290
They ruined our lives, andy!

00:33:05.290 --> 00:33:08.430
We could've been
together this whole time

00:33:08.430 --> 00:33:11.040
Instead of alone.

00:33:11.730 --> 00:33:14.920
I couldn't let them do that. I
couldn't let them get away with that.

00:33:16.120 --> 00:33:17.920
No.

00:33:28.830 --> 00:33:31.490
I see you.

00:33:32.440 --> 00:33:34.740
Bye-Bye.

00:34:09.680 --> 00:34:11.980
He shot himself.

00:34:12.410 --> 00:34:14.920
And you all saw it happen.

00:34:16.280 --> 00:34:19.020
Yeah. We did.

00:34:19.820 --> 00:34:22.400
Look at him. He's getting better at it.

00:34:40.460 --> 00:34:42.400
She won't even look at me.

00:34:43.070 --> 00:34:45.350
Yeah, she's pretty shaken up.

00:34:45.350 --> 00:34:48.500
No,it's -This is different.

00:34:48.500 --> 00:34:50.630
This
is --

00:34:50.630 --> 00:34:55.070
I never used my mind thing on
her before,before last night.

00:34:57.540 --> 00:35:00.040
She's scared of me now.

00:35:04.650 --> 00:35:07.380
Andy,I hate to do this, but,um...

00:35:08.950 --> 00:35:11.600
We have to get out of here. Here.

00:35:12.070 --> 00:35:14.160
I wrote down my cell.

00:35:15.010 --> 00:35:20.810
You don't have to be alone in this,all right?
If anything comes up,you can call me up.

00:35:25.040 --> 00:35:30.340
Wh-What am I supposed to do now?

00:35:30.340 --> 00:35:32.690
You be good,andy...

00:35:33.100 --> 00:35:35.040
Or we'll be back.

00:35:43.010 --> 00:35:44.620
Looks like I was right.

00:35:44.620 --> 00:35:46.480
About what? Andy.

00:35:47.030 --> 00:35:49.450
He's a killer after all.

00:35:50.040 --> 00:35:53.010
No,he's a hero. He saved his
girlfriend's life. He saved my life.

00:35:53.010 --> 00:35:56.440
Bottom line, last night
he wasted somebody.

00:35:56.440 --> 00:35:59.110
Yeah,but he's not a
foaming-At-The-Mouth psycho.

00:35:59.110 --> 00:36:02.060
He was just -He was pushed into that.

00:36:02.060 --> 00:36:04.300
Webber was pushed,too, in his own way.

00:36:04.300 --> 00:36:07.040
Max miller was pushed. Hell,I
was pushed by jessica's death.

00:36:07.040 --> 00:36:08.070
What's your point,sam?

00:36:08.070 --> 00:36:10.810
Right circumstances, everyone
is capable of murder -Everyone.

00:36:11.900 --> 00:36:15.240
Maybe that's what the demon is doing
-Pushing us,finding ways to break us.

00:36:15.240 --> 00:36:17.930
We don't know what the demon wants,okay?

00:36:17.930 --> 00:36:20.030
Quit worrying about it.

00:36:21.030 --> 00:36:23.950
You know,I heard you before,dean,
when andy made you tell the truth.

00:36:24.480 --> 00:36:26.280
You're just as scared of this as I am.

00:36:26.280 --> 00:36:30.140
That was mind control! It's like
being roofied man. That doesn't count.

00:36:30.140 --> 00:36:32.890
No,I-I'm calling
do-Over. What are you,7?

00:36:32.890 --> 00:36:35.310
Doesn't matter. We just got
to keep doing what we're doing,

00:36:35.310 --> 00:36:37.500
Find that evil son of
a bitch, and kill it.

00:36:40.480 --> 00:36:42.460
Yeah. I guess.

00:36:44.970 --> 00:36:46.670
Hello?

00:36:47.530 --> 00:36:50.190
Ellen. What's going on?

00:36:52.300 --> 00:36:54.640
Yeah. We'll be right there.

00:37:01.530 --> 00:37:03.400
Jo?

00:37:03.400 --> 00:37:05.180
Go pull up another case of beer.

00:37:05.180 --> 00:37:07.420
Mom --
Now. Please?

00:37:10.910 --> 00:37:14.860
So,you,uh,you want to tell me
about this last hunt of yours?

00:37:15.920 --> 00:37:17.670
Nope. Not really.

00:37:19.740 --> 00:37:23.060
No offense. Just kind of a family thing.

00:37:23.650 --> 00:37:25.450
Not anymore.

00:37:26.350 --> 00:37:28.500
I got this stuff from ash.

00:37:30.580 --> 00:37:34.430
Andrew gallagher's house burned down on
his 6-Month birthday,just like your house.

00:37:35.140 --> 00:37:38.760
You think it was the demon both times,don't
you? You think it went after gallagher's family?

00:37:39.430 --> 00:37:40.850
Yeah,we think so. Sam.

00:37:40.850 --> 00:37:43.030
Why? None of your business.

00:37:43.370 --> 00:37:45.020
You mind your tongue with me,boy.

00:37:45.020 --> 00:37:47.050
This isn't just your war. This is war.

00:37:47.050 --> 00:37:50.550
Something big and bad is coming,and it's
coming fast,and their side holds all the cards.

00:37:50.550 --> 00:37:54.140
Now,at best,all we got is us -Together.

00:37:55.570 --> 00:37:57.970
No secrets or half-Truths here.

00:38:02.130 --> 00:38:04.310
There are people out there

00:38:04.310 --> 00:38:06.800
Like andy gallagher...

00:38:08.340 --> 00:38:10.780
Like me...

00:38:11.180 --> 00:38:13.570
And,um...

00:38:14.120 --> 00:38:16.330
We all have some kind of ability.

00:38:16.330 --> 00:38:17.970
Ability? Yeah.

00:38:17.970 --> 00:38:20.240
A psychic ability.

00:38:20.770 --> 00:38:23.310
Me,I have,um...

00:38:24.510 --> 00:38:26.820
I have visions...

00:38:27.250 --> 00:38:31.350
Premonitions. I don't know.
It's different for everybody.

00:38:33.920 --> 00:38:37.460
The demon said he had
plans for people like us.

00:38:37.460 --> 00:38:38.920
What kind of plans?

00:38:38.920 --> 00:38:40.140
We don't really know for sure.

00:38:40.140 --> 00:38:42.880
These people out there, these
psychics,are they dangerous?

00:38:42.880 --> 00:38:44.760
No.

00:38:44.760 --> 00:38:46.140
Not all of them.

00:38:46.140 --> 00:38:47.280
But some are. Some are very dangerous.

00:38:47.280 --> 00:38:48.630
How many?

00:38:48.630 --> 00:38:51.100
We've been able to track
a clear pattern so far.

00:38:51.100 --> 00:38:53.900
They've all had house fires on the
night of the kid's 6-Month birthday.

00:38:53.900 --> 00:38:56.000
That's not true.

00:38:56.740 --> 00:38:58.010
What?

00:38:58.010 --> 00:39:03.290
Webber or ansem weems or
whatever his name is --

00:39:04.660 --> 00:39:08.050
I looked at his files, and
there was no house fire.

00:39:08.440 --> 00:39:10.930
There's nothing out of the ordinary.

00:39:11.710 --> 00:39:15.110
Which breaks pattern. So if
there's any others like him,

00:39:15.110 --> 00:39:16.950
There would be nothing in the system,

00:39:16.950 --> 00:39:19.090
No way to track them all down.

00:39:20.340 --> 00:39:23.540
And so who knows how many
of them are really out there?

